  "description": "<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Earth and Moon is a self-started, quick-growing brand that provides affordable, alternative solutions to health and wellbeing.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Our team have one thing in common. We've always had a passion for the outdoors. Surfing, running, and physical fitness are some of our favorite pastimes. They help us stay grounded, connected to nature, and able to tackle life&rsquo;s challenges.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">It is our love for the great outdoors that led us to want to help people invest in the innate power of nature, rather than taking from it. We wanted to help give people a way to connect with nature and feel good every day.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">An Earth and Moon grounding mat is a safe and easy solution for grounding at home. Made with soft, durable leatherette, an eco-conscious synthetic polyurethane that&rsquo;s highly conductive and totally comfortable.&nbsp;It&rsquo;s also nontoxic, vegan, and designed perfectly to fit any space in your home, office or studio.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">We want to help others incorporate grounding into their lifestyle without the hassle of changing their routine.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Join our affiliate program to earn 20% commission on sales and join a like-minded group of people looking to reconnect with the innate power of nature, one grounding mat at a time.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">To finding your ground,</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">Earth and Moon</p>\r\n</div>",
